[38;2;124;124;124mWait, that's weak convergence in $Y^*$, which is $\sigma(Y^*, Y^{**})$. But we [0m
[38;2;124;124;124mwant weak convergence in $Y^*$, which is $\sigma(Y^*, Y^{**})$. Yes, that's what[0m[38;2;124;124;124mweak convergence means.[0m

