[38;2;124;124;124mordinary limit. They exist by the Hahn-Banach theorem (this is a classical [0m
[38;2;124;124;124mresult). A Banach limit $L$ satisfies:[0m
[38;2;124;124;124m- $L(x) \geq 0$ if $x \geq 0$[0m
